# A read serves a body for a stamp the receiver's catalog cannot decode.
MODULE: ReadsServeOrFailMisdecodes
TARGET: ReadsServeOrFail
CLASS: Action
SUMMARY: an undecodable stamp is served instead of failing explicitly
PERTURBS: Read

--- FIND
    /\ lastRead' = [e |-> e, out |-> IF Servable(tag[e]) THEN "Body" ELSE "Fail"]
--- REPLACE
    /\ lastRead' = [e |-> e, out |-> "Body"]
--- END
